<translation id="1149651794389918149">Ngena ngemvume ku-tomi. Uma ufuna ukungena ngemvume ku-akhawunti kanye kuphela, <ph name="GUEST_LINK_BEGIN" />ungasebenzisa idivayisi njengesivakashi<ph name="GUEST_LINK_END" />.</translation>
