<translation id="1335640173511558774">I-<ph name="MANAGER" /> idinga ukuthi ufunde uphinde wamukele Imigomo Yesevisi elandelayo ngaphambi kokusebenzisa le divayisi. Le migomo ayinwebeki, ayiguquki, noma ayikhawuleli Imigomo ye-tomiOS Flex.</translation>
<translation id="1341711321000856656">Ungashintsha ukuze ubone amaphasiwedi kusuka kwenye iphrofayela ye-tomi</translation>
<translation id="1363996462118479832">I-tomiOS ayikwazanga ukuvumelanisa idatha yakho ngenxa yephutha lokungena ngemvume.</translation>
<translation id="137466361146087520">I-beta ye-tomi</translation>
<translation id="1399397803214730675">Le khompyutha isivele inenguqulo yakamuva ye-tomi. Uma isofthiwe ingasebenzi, sicela ukhiphe i-tomi uphinde uzame futhi.</translation>
<translation id="139993653570221430">Ungashintsha umqondo wakho noma kunini kumasethingi we-tomi. Izivivinyo zisebenza eduze kwendlela yamanje yokulethwa kwezikhangiso, ngakho ngeke ubone izinguquko ngokushesha.</translation>
<translation id="1407223320754252908">I-tomi ine-tomi Translate eyakhelwe ngaphakathi ngakho-ke ungahumusha uma kumele wenze kanjalo</translation>
<translation id="1425903838053942728">{COUNT,plural, =0{I-tomi iqedile ukuvuselela. Ungasebenzisa uhlobo lwakamuva ngokushesha nje lapho uqalisa kabusha. Ngemuva kwalokho, amathebhu akho amanje azovulwa kabusha.}=1{I-tomi iqedile ukuvuselela. Ungasebenzisa uhlobo lwakamuva ngokushesha nje lapho uqalisa kabusha. Ngemuva kwalokho, amathebhu akho amanje azovulwa kabusha. Iwindi lakho le-Incognito ngeke liphinde livuleke.}one{I-tomi iqedile ukuvuselela. Ungasebenzisa uhlobo lwakamuva ngokushesha nje lapho uqalisa kabusha. Ngemuva kwalokho, amathebhu akho amanje azovulwa kabusha. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}other{I-tomi iqedile ukuvuselela. Ungasebenzisa uhlobo lwakamuva ngokushesha nje lapho uqalisa kabusha. Ngemuva kwalokho, amathebhu akho amanje azovulwa kabusha. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}}</translation>
