<translation id="1507198376417198979">Yenza ngendlela oyifisayo iphrofayela yakho entsha ye-tomi</translation>
<translation id="1547295885616600893">I-tomiOS Flex yenzeka ngenxa <ph name="BEGIN_LINK_CROS_OSS" />yesofthiwe yomthombo ovulekile eyengeziwe<ph name="END_LINK_CROS_OSS" />.</translation>
<translation id="1553358976309200471">Buyekeza i-tomi</translation>
<translation id="1583073672411044740">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER" /> usengenile ngemvume kakade kule phrofayela ye-tomi. Lokhu kuzodalela u-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" /> iphrofayela entsha ye-tomi</translation>
<translation id="1587223624401073077">I-tomi isebenzisa ikhamela yakho.</translation>
<translation id="1587325591171447154">I-<ph name="FILE_NAME" /> iyingozi, ngakho-ke i-tomi iyivimbile.</translation>
<translation id="1597911401261118146">Ukuze uhlole uma ngabe amaphasiwedi akho aphephile kusukela ekuphulweni kwedatha nakwezinye izinkinga zokuvikela, <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />ngena ngemvume ku-<ph name="END_LINK" />.</translation>
<translation id="1619887657840448962">Ukuze kwenziwe i-tomi iphephile, sikhubaza isandiso esilandelayo esingafakiwe kuhlu ku-<ph name="IDS_EXTENSION_WEB_STORE_TITLE" /> futhi kungenzeka singezwe ngaphandle kolwazi lakho.</translation>
<translation id="1627304841979541023"><ph name="BEGIN_BOLD" />Ungayiphatha kanjani idatha yakho:<ph name="END_BOLD" /> Ukuze sivikele ubumfihlo bakho, sisula ngokuzenzakalelayo izintshisekelo zakho ezindala kunamaviki ama-4. Njengoba uqhubeka nokubhrawuza, intshisekelo ingase ivele ohlwini futhi. Noma ungasusa izithakazelo ongafuni ukuthi i-tomi izicabangele.</translation>
<translation id="1628000112320670027">Thola usizo nge-tomi</translation>
<translation id="1640672724030957280">Iyadawuniloda...</translation>
<translation id="1662146548738125461">Mayelana ne-tomiOS Flex</translation>
<translation id="1674870198290878346">Vula isixhumanisi kuwindi le-tomi Inco&amp;gnito</translation>
<translation id="1682634494516646069">I-tomi ayikwazi ukufunda nokubhala kumkhombandlela wayo wedatha:

<ph name="USER_DATA_DIRECTORY" /></translation>
<translation id="1689338313606606627">Itomi ingenza le thebhu ingasebenzi ukuze ithuthukise ukuzizwisa kwakho ukubhrawuza futhi igcine izinto zishesha.</translation>
<translation id="1698376642261615901">I-tomi isiphequluli sewebhu esisebenzisa amakhasi ewebhu nezinhlelo zokusebenza ezinejubane elikhulu kakhulu. Iyashesha, ayiguquki, futhi kulula ukuyisebenzisa. Dlulisa amehlo kuwebhu ngendlela ephephile nakakhulu ngokuvikelwa ku-malware nobugebengu bokweba imininingwane ebucayi okwakhelwe ku-tomi.</translation>
<translation id="1713301662689114961">{0,plural, =1{I-tomi izoqalisa kabusha kwihora}one{I-tomi izoqalisa kabusha emahoreni angu-#}other{I-tomi izoqalisa kabusha emahoreni angu-#}}</translation>
<translation id="1722488837206509557">Lokhu kuzokuvumela ukuthi ukhethe emadivayisini atholakalayo futhi ubonise okuqukethwe kuwo.</translation>
<translation id="1734234790201236882">I-tomi izolondoloza le phasiwedi ku-akhawunti yakho ye-tomi. Ngeke kudingeke ukuthi uyikhumbule.</translation>
<translation id="1786003790898721085">Yenza isiqinisekiso sokuthi ungene ngemvume ku-tomi ku-<ph name="TARGET_DEVICE_NAME" /> yakho bese uzama ukuthumela futhi.</translation>
<translation id="1786044937610313874">Izinqamuleli zivuleka ku-tomi</translation>
<translation id="178701303897325119">Lesi sandiso asisasekelwa. Itomi incoma ukuthi usisuse esikhundleni salokho.</translation>
<translation id="1812689907177901597">Ngokuvala lokhu, ungangena ngemvume kumasayithi e-tomi njenge-Gmail ngaphandle kokungena ngemvume ku-tomi</translation>
<translation id="1860536484129686729">I-tomi idinga imvume yokufinyelela kukhamera yakho kule sayithi</translation>
<translation id="1873233029667955273">I-tomi akusona isiphequluli sakho esizenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="1874309113135274312">I-beta yetomi (mDNS-In)</translation>
<translation id="1877026089748256423">I-tomi ingaphandle kwedethi</translation>
<translation id="1907925560334657849">Ukuze wabelane ngewindi lakho, vumela ukurekhodwa kwesikrini kwe-tomi Kokuncanyelwayo Kwesistimu</translation>
<translation id="1919130412786645364">Vumela ukungena ngemvume kwe-tomi</translation>
<translation id="1953553007165777902">Iyadawuniloda... Kusele imizuzu engu-<ph name="MINUTE" /></translation>
<translation id="1982647487457769627">I-tomi isebenza ezinkundleni ezihlukile ukukunikeza umuzwa ojwayelekile kungakhathaliseki ukuthi idivayisi injani</translation>
<translation id="2001586581944147178">Kwenze kube nzima kubantu abanokufinyelela kuthrafikhi yakho ye-inthanethi ukuze babone ukuthi imaphi amasayithi owavakashelayo. I-tomi isebenzisa ukuxhuma okuvikelekile ukuze ibheke ikheli lasesizindeni se-inthanethi lesayithi ku-DNS (Isistimu Yokwetha Isizinda).</translation>
<translation id="2008942457798486387">{NUM_EXTENSIONS,plural, =1{Lesi sandiso asisasekelwa. Itomi incoma ukuthi usisuse.}one{Lezi zandiso azisasekelwa. Itomi incoma ukuthi uzisuse.}other{Lezi zandiso azisasekelwa. Itomi incoma ukuthi uzisuse.}}</translation>
<translation id="2018528049276128029">Iphrofayela ngalinye linolwazi lwayo lwe-tomi njengamabhukhimakhi, umlando, amaphasiwedi, nokuningi</translation>
<translation id="2018879682492276940">Ukufakwa kwehlulekile. Sicela uzame futhi.</translation>
<translation id="2022471217832964798">Ngenkathi sisetha ukufinyelela ku-akhawunti, usengasebenzisa itomi. Ungase ungakwazi ukufinyelela ezinye izinsiza kuze kuqedwe ukusetha.</translation>
<translation id="2034233344106846793">Itomi ithuthukisa ukuxhuma okungavikelekile ku-HTTPS ngokuzenzekelayo lapho kungenzeka</translation>
<translation id="207902854391093810">Lapho imizamo ivuliwe, Isilinganiso sesikhangiso sivumela amasayithi owavakashelayo ukuba acele ulwazi ku-tomi olusiza isayithi ukukala ukusebenza kwezikhangiso zawo. Isilinganiso sesikhangiso sikhawulela ukulandelela indawo yonke ngokudlulisa ulwazi oluncane ngangokunokwenzeka phakathi kwamasayithi.</translation>
<translation id="2091012649849228750">Ukuze uthole izibuyekezo zesikhathi esizayo ze-tomi, uzodinga i-Windows 10 noma yakamuva. Le khompyutha isebenzisa i-Windows 8.</translation>
<translation id="2094648590148273905">Imigomo ye-tomiOS Flex</translation>
<translation id="2094919256425865063">Yekela i-tomi yize kunjalo?</translation>
<translation id="2106831557840787829">I-tomiOS Flex yenzeka <ph name="BEGIN_LINK_CROS_OSS" />ngenxa yesofthiwe yomthombo ovulekile eyengeziwe<ph name="END_LINK_CROS_OSS" />, njengoba kunjalo <ph name="BEGIN_LINK_LINUX_OSS" />ngendawo yokuthuthukiswa kwe-Linux<ph name="END_LINK_LINUX_OSS" />.</translation>
<translation id="2120620239521071941">Lokhu kuzosusa izinto ezingu-<ph name="ITEMS_COUNT" /> kusuka kule divayisi. kuze uthole idatha yakho emuva kwesikhathi, ngena ngemvume ku-tomi njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL" />.</translation>
<translation id="2121284319307530122">Qalisa kabusha ukuze Ubuyekeze i-&amp;tomi</translation>
<translation id="2123055963409958220">Siza ukwenza i-tomi ibengcono ngokubika <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />izilungiselelo zamanje<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="2126108037660393668">Ifayela elidawunilodiwe aliphumelelanga lapho liqinisekiswa.</translation>
<translation id="2128411189117340671">Phatha amaphrofayela e-tomi</translation>
<translation id="2131230230468101642">Ukuze sivikele ubumfihlo bakho, sisula ngokuzenzakalelayo izintshisekelo zakho ezindala kunamaviki ama-4. Njengoba uqhubeka nokubhrawuza, intshisekelo ingase ivele ohlwini futhi. Noma ungasusa izithakazelo ongafuni ukuthi i-tomi izicabangele.</translation>
<translation id="2139300032719313227">Qalisa kabusha i-tomiOS</translation>
<translation id="2151406531797534936">Sicela uqalise kabusha -tomi manje</translation>
<translation id="2174917724755363426">Ukufaka akuqediwe. Uqinisekile ufuna ukukhansela?</translation>
<translation id="2190166659037789668">Buyekeza iphutha lokuchekha: <ph name="UPDATE_CHECK_ERROR" />.</translation>
<translation id="2199691482078155239">I-tomi ikunikeza ukulawula okwengeziwe ezikhangisweni ozibonayo futhi ikhawulela lokho amasayithi angakufunda ngawe uma ekubonisa izikhangiso eziqondene nawe</translation>
<translation id="2216543877350048334">Ukuze ususe i-tomi Account yakho ku-tomi, phuma ngemvume</translation>
<translation id="223889379102603431">Ulwazi olumayelana nendlela i-tomi ephatha ngayo izitifiketi zayo zempande</translation>
<translation id="2258103955319320201">Ukuze ufinyelele ezintweni zakho ze-browser ye-tomi kuwo wonke amadivayisi wakho, ngena ngemvume, bese uvula ukuvumelanisa</translation>
<translation id="2290014774651636340">Okhiye be-tomi API abekho. Okunye ukusebenza kwe-tomi kuzokhutshazwa.</translation>
<translation id="2290095356545025170">Ingabe uqinisekile ukuthi ufuna ukukhipha i-tomi?</translation>
<translation id="2309047409763057870">Lokhu ukufakwa kwesibili kwe-tomi, futhi akukwazi ukwenziwa isiphequluli sakho esizenzakalelayo.</translation>
<translation id="2345992953227471816">I-tomi ithole ukuthi lezi zandiso zinohlelo olungayilungele ikhompyutha:</translation>
<translation id="2348335408836342058">I-tomi idinga imvume ukuze ifinyelele kukhamera yakho nemakrofoni yaleli sayithi</translation>
<translation id="234869673307233423">I-tomi ayikwazi ukuhlola amaphasiwedi akho. Zama futhi emuva kwesikhathi.</translation>
<translation id="235650106824528204">Noma iyiphi idatha ye-tomi ekhiqizwa ngesikhathi sokusetshenziswa kwale phrofayela (efana nokudalwa kwamabhukhimakhi, umlando, amaphasiwedi, namanye amasethingi) ingasuswa umlawuli wephrofayela yomsebenzi. <ph name="LEARN_MORE" /></translation>
<translation id="2359808026110333948">Qhubeka</translation>
<translation id="2390624519615263404">Buka izakhi zokuphepha</translation>
<translation id="2401189691232800402">Isistimu ye-tomiOS</translation>
<translation id="2409816192575564775">{NUM_DEVICES,plural, =0{Idivayisi e-1 ye-HID ibifinyelelwa yisandiso se-tomi esisodwa noma eziningi}=1{Idivayisi e-1 ye-HID ifinyelelwa yisandiso se-tomi esisodwa noma eziningi}one{Amadivayisi angu-# e-HID abefinyelelwa yisandiso se-tomi esisodwa noma eziningi}other{Amadivayisi angu-# e-HID abefinyelelwa yisandiso se-tomi esisodwa noma eziningi}}</translation>
<translation id="2424440923901031101">Lesi sandiso sephula inqubomgomo Yesitolo sewebu se-tomi, futhi kungenzeka singabi esiphephile. Sisuse ku-tomi ukuze singasakwazi ukubona nokushintsha idatha yakho kumasayithi owavakashelayo, okufaka phakathi ulwazi lwakho lomuntu siqu.</translation>
<translation id="2467438592969358367">I-tomi ifuna ukuthumela amaphasiwedi akho. Thayipha iphasiwedi yakho ye-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="2472092250898121027">Lesi sandiso sinohlelo olungayilungele ikhompyutha futhi asiphephile. Sisuse ku-tomi ukuze singasakwazi ukubona nokushintsha idatha yakho kumasayithi owavakashelayo, okufaka phakathi ulwazi lwakho lomuntu siqu.</translation>
<translation id="2485422356828889247">Khipha</translation>
<translation id="2513154137948333830">Ukuqalisa kuyadingeka: <ph name="INSTALL_SUCCESS" /></translation>
<translation id="2534365042754120737">Ukuvikela idatha lakho vumela i-tomi isuse izimvume kumasayithi ongakawavakasheli muva nje. Ayizimisi izaziso.</translation>
<translation id="2556847002339236023">Inhlangano yakho ivala i-tomi uma ingasetshenziswa isikhathi eingu-<ph name="TIMEOUT_DURATION" />. Idatha yokubhrawuza isuliwe. Lokhu kungase kuhlanganise umlando, ukugcwalisa ngokuzenzakalelayo, nokudawuniloda.</translation>
<translation id="2559253115192232574">Kamuva, isayithi olivakashelayo lingacela i-tomi ukuthi ibone izintshisekelo zakho ukuze yenze izikhangiso ozibonayo ngokwezifiso zakho. I-tomi ikwazi ukwabelana ngezintshisekelo ezifika ku-3.</translation>
<translation id="2563121210305478421">Qalisa kabusha i-tomi?</translation>
<translation id="2569974318947988067">I-tomi izozama ukuthuthukisa ukufuna ukuya ku-HTTPS</translation>
<translation id="2571392474191184472">Inhlangano yakho iphatha itomi</translation>
<translation id="2574930892358684005">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER" /> usengenile ngemvume kakade kule phrofayela ye-tomi. Ukuze uqhubeke nokuphequlula ngokwehlukile, i-tomi ingakwazi ukukudalela iphrofayela yakho.</translation>
<translation id="2580411288591421699">Ayikwazi ukufaka inguqulo ye-tomi efana nalena esebenza manje. Sicela uvale i-tomi uphinde uzame futhi.</translation>
<translation id="2586406160782125153">Lokhu kuzosusa idatha yakho yokuphequlula kusukela kule divayisi. Ukuze uthole idatha yakho emuva kwesikhathi, ngena ngemvume ku-tomi njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL" />.</translation>
<translation id="2597976513418770460">Thola ibhrawuza yakho ye-tomi kusukela ku-<ph name="ACCOUNT_EMAIL" /></translation>
<translation id="259935314519650377">Yehlulekile ukufaka enqolobaneni isifaki esidawunilodiwe. Iphutha: <ph name="UNPACK_CACHING_ERROR_CODE" />.</translation>
<translation id="2622559029861875898">I-tomi ayikwazi ukuhlola izibuyekezo. Zama ukuhlola ukuxhumeka kwakho ku-inthanethi.</translation>
<translation id="2632707915638608719">Yenza okuningi ngezandiso ze-tomi</translation>
<translation id="2645435784669275700">I-tomiOS</translation>
<translation id="2649768380733403658">I-tomi ihlale ihlola ukuze iqinisekise ukuthi ibhrawuza inamasethingi aphephe kakhulu. Sizokwazisa uma kukhona okudinga ukubuyekezwa.</translation>
<translation id="2652691236519827073">Vula isixhumanisi ku&amp;thebhu entsha ye-tomi</translation>
<translation id="2665296953892887393">Siza wenze i-tomi ibe ngcono ngokuthumela imibiko yokuphahlazeka ne-<ph name="UMA_LINK" /> ku-tomi</translation>
<translation id="2681444469812712297">Vula i-<ph name="URL" /> ethebhini entsha ye-tomi.</translation>
<translation id="2738871930057338499">Ayikwazi ukuxhuma ku-inthanethi I-HTTP 403 Yenqatshelwe. Sicela uchekhe ukulungiselelwa kommeleli wakho.</translation>
<translation id="2742320827292110288">Isexwayiso: I-tomi ayikwazi ukuvimbela izandiso kusukela ekurekhodeni umlando wesiphequluli sakho. Ukuze ukhubaze lesi sandiso kumodi ye-incognito, yekisa ukukhetha le nketho.</translation>
<translation id="2765403129283291972">I-tomi idinga imvume ukuze ifinyelele kukhamera yakho kuleli sayithi</translation>
<translation id="2770231113462710648">Guqula isiphequluli esizenzakalelayo sibe yi-:</translation>
<translation id="2775140325783767197">I-tomi ayikwazi ukuhlola amaphasiwedi akho. Zama ukuhlola ukuxhumeka kwakho ku-inthanethi.</translation>
<translation id="2797864378188255696">Uma ungena ngemvume kumasevisi etomi afana neGmail noma iYouTube nge-<ph name="USER_EMAIL" />, ungangena ngemvume ngokuzenzakalela kutomi nge-akhawunti efanayo</translation>
<translation id="2799223571221894425">Qalisa kabusha</translation>
<translation id="2825024317344269723">Isayithi eyingozi. I-tomi isuse izaziso.</translation>
<translation id="2846251086934905009">Iphutha lokufaka: Isifaki asiqedanga. Ukufakwa kukhanseliwe.</translation>
<translation id="2847461019998147611">Bonisa i-tomi ngalolu limi</translation>
