<translation id="3114643501466072395">Ukuze uhlole ukuba amanye amaphasiwedi akho aphephile yini kusukela ekuphulweni kwedatha nezinye izinkinga zezokuvikela, <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />ngena ngemvume ku-tomi<ph name="END_LINK" />.</translation>
