<translation id="3785324443014631273">I-tomiOS Flex ayikwazanga ukuvumelanisa idatha yakho ngenxa yephutha lokungena ngemvume.</translation>
<translation id="3795971588916395511">I-tomiOS</translation>
<translation id="3809772425479558446">I-tomi idinga i-Windows 7 noma ngaphezulu.</translation>
<translation id="3835168907083856002">Lokhu kuzodalela u-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" /> iphrofayela entsha ye-tomi</translation>
<translation id="383928141529488001">I-tomi idinga ukufinyelela kwe-Bluetooth ukuze ihlole amadivayisi we-Bluetooth. <ph name="IDS_SERIAL_DEVICE_CHOOSER_AUTHORIZE_BLUETOOTH_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="386202838227397562">Sicela uvale wonke amawindi we-tomi bese uzama futhi.</translation>
