<translation id="3889417619312448367">Khipha i-tomi</translation>
<translation id="3941890832296813527">Iphutha lokufaka: Igama lefayela lesifaki alivumelekile noma alisekelwe.</translation>
<translation id="3973161977468201858">Itomi ifuna ukusula idatha yakho Yomphathi Wephasiwedi yetomi. Thayipha iphasiwedi yakho yeWindows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="398236277091248993">I-tomi ihlala ishesha ngezakhi ezinika amandla ukusebenza</translation>
<translation id="3999683152997576765">Ungabona futhi ususe izihloko zesayithi ongaba nentshisekelo kuzo ezisetshenziswa ukukubonisa izikhangiso. I-tomi izolinganisa ongaba nentshisekelo kukho ngokusekelwe kumlando wakho wakamuva wokubhrawuza.</translation>
<translation id="4035053306113201399">I-tomiOS idinga ukuqaliswa kabusha ukuze yenze kusebenze isibuyekezo.</translation>
<translation id="4050175100176540509">Ukuthuthukiswa kokuphepha okubalulekile nezici ezintsha kuyathokala kunguqulo yakamuva.</translation>
<translation id="4053720452172726777">Yenza ngokwezifiso futhi lawula i-tomi</translation>
<translation id="408393047846373801">Ukuze uthole amaphasiwedi akho kanye nokwengeziwe kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho, ngena ngemvume kutomi. Le phasiwedi izolondolozwa kutomi Account yakho ngemva kokungena ngemvume.</translation>
<translation id="4084404300720192944">Ukuze wabelane ngewindi lakho, vumela ukurekhodwa kwesikrini kwetomi Kokuncanyelwayo Kwesistimu.</translation>
<translation id="4106587138345390261">I-tomi ihlola izakhi ezintsha ezivumela amasayithi ukuthi alethe ukuzizwisa kokubhrawuza okufanayo kusetshenziswa ulwazi lwakho oluncane</translation>
<translation id="4110895483821904099">Setha iphrofayela yakho entsha ye-tomi</translation>
<translation id="4111566860456076004">I-tomi ayikwazi ukuqinisekisa ukuthi lesi sandiso sivelaphi, futhi kungenzeka ukuthi asiphephile. Sisuse ku-tomi ukuze singasakwazi ukubona nokushintsha idatha yakho kumasayithi owavakashelayo, okufaka phakathi ulwazi lomuntu siqu.</translation>
<translation id="4128488089242627000">I-tomi iyashesha ukuqalisa futhi izathi ezisebenzisa i-JavaScript kufanele zisebenze njengoba ziklanyiwe (okunconywayo)</translation>
<translation id="4147555960264124640">Ungena ngemvume nge-akhawunti ephethwe futhi unikeza umlawuli wayo ukulawula okungaphezulu kwephrofayela yakho ye-tomi. Idatha yakho ye-tomi, efana nezinhlelo zokusebenza zakho, amabhukhimakhi, umlando, amaphasiwedi, nezinye izilungiselelo zizoboshezelwa ngonaphakade ku-<ph name="USER_NAME" />. Uzokwazi ukususa le datha nge-tomi ama-Akhawunti we-Ideshibhodi, kodwa ngeke uze ukwazi ukuhlobanisa le datha nenye i-akhawunti. <ph name="LEARN_MORE" /></translation>
<translation id="4148957013307229264">Iyafaka...</translation>
<translation id="4149882025268051530">Isifaki sihlulekile ukungaminyanisi ingobo yomlando. Sicela ulande i-tomi futhi.</translation>
<translation id="4153934450158521343">I-tomi izovala maduzane futhi isule idatha</translation>
<translation id="4173512894976930765">Amasayithi cishe azosebenza njengokulindelwe. Uzophuma ngemvume kumasayithi amaningi uma uvala wonke amawindi e-tomi, ngaphandle kwe-tomi Account yakho uma ungene ngemvume ku-tomi.</translation>
<translation id="4175922240926474352">I-tomi ivimbele lokhu kulanda ngoba isayithi alisebenzisi uxhumano oluvikelekile futhi kungenzeka ukuthi ifayela lonaniwe.</translation>
<translation id="4191857738314598978">{0,plural, =1{Qalisa kabusha i-tomi phakathi nosuku}one{Qalisa kabusha i-tomi phakathi kwezinsuku ezingu-#}other{Qalisa kabusha i-tomi phakathi kwezinsuku ezingu-#}}</translation>
<translation id="4205939740494406371">I-tomi ayikwazi ukuhlola amaphasiwedi akho. Zama futhi ngemva kwamahora angu-24 noma <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />hlola amaphasiwedi ku-akhawunti yakho ye-tomi<ph name="END_LINK" />.</translation>
<translation id="4222932583846282852">Iyakhansela...</translation>
<translation id="4224210481850767180">Ukufaka kukhanseliwe.</translation>
<translation id="4242034826641750751">I-tomi idinga izimvume zekhamera nemakrofoni kule sayithi</translation>
<translation id="424864128008805179">Phuma ngemvume ku-tomi?</translation>
<translation id="4251615635259297716">Xhumanisa idatha yakho ye-tomi kule akhawunti?</translation>
<translation id="4262915912852657291"><ph name="BEGIN_BOLD" />Iyiphi idatha esetshenziswayo:<ph name="END_BOLD" /> Umlando wakho wokubhrawuza, irekhodi lamasayithi owavakashele usebenzisa i-tomi kule divayisi.</translation>
<translation id="4281844954008187215">Imigomo yesevisi</translation>
<translation id="4293420128516039005">Ngena ngemvume ukuze uvumelanise uphinde wenze kube ngeyakho i-tomi kuwo onke amadivayisi akho</translation>
<translation id="430327780270213103">Vumela isandiso ukuze ubonise izicelo zokufinyelela kubha yamathuluzi ye-tomi</translation>
<translation id="4328355335528187361">I-tomi Dev (mDNS-In)</translation>
<translation id="4329315893554541805">Ukuze uthole ukwenza ngokomuntu ngamunye nezinye izakhi, ezifaka i-tomi Kumsebenzi wewebhu nowe-app nakumasevisi alinkiwe e-tomi</translation>
<translation id="4334294535648607276">Ukulanda kuqedile.</translation>
<translation id="4335235004908507846">I-tomi ingasiza ukukugcina uphephile kusukela ekuphulweni kwedatha, izandiso ezimbi, nokuningi</translation>
<translation id="4343195214584226067">I-<ph name="EXTENSION_NAME" /> ingezwe ku-tomi</translation>
<translation id="4348548358339558429">Ukuze uthole ukwenza ngokomuntu ngamunye, okufaka i-tomi Kumsebenzi Wewebhu nowe-App</translation>
<translation id="436060642166082913">I-tomi ivimbele lokhu kudawuniloda ngoba ifayela lingalimaza ama-akhawunti wakho omuntu siqu nawenethiwekhi yokuxhumana nomphakathi</translation>
<translation id="4384570495110188418">I-tomi ayikwazi ukuhlola amaphasiwedi akho ngoba awungenanga ngemvume</translation>
<translation id="4389991535395284064">Uma ubhrawuza ngemodi ye-Incognito, i-tomi izokuxwayisa ngaphambi kokulayisha isayithi isebenzisa uxhumo olungavikelekile.</translation>
<translation id="4427306783828095590">Isivikelo esithuthukisiwe senza okuningi ukuvimba ubugebengu bokweba imininingwane ebucayi kanye uhlelo olungayilungele ikhompyutha</translation>
<translation id="4434353761996769206">Iphutha lesifaki: <ph name="INSTALLER_ERROR" /></translation>
<translation id="4438657683599538446">Ngena ngemvume kutomi njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL" /></translation>
<translation id="4450664632294415862">I-tomi - Inethiwekhi Yokungena ngemvume - <ph name="PAGE_TITLE" /></translation>
<translation id="4458462641685292929">Okunye ukusebenza ku-tomi kuyenzeka manje. Sicela uzame futhi emuva kwesikhathi.</translation>
<translation id="4459234553906210702">Isilinganiso sesikhangiso sivumela amasayithi owavakashelayo ukuba acele ulwazi ku-tomi olusiza isayithi ukukala ukusebenza kwezikhangiso zawo. Isilinganiso sesikhangiso sikhawulela ukulandelela indawo yonke ngokudlulisa ulwazi oluncane ngangokunokwenzeka phakathi kwamasayithi.</translation>
<translation id="4501471624619070934">Ukufaka kuhlulekile ngoba ukufinyelela kukhawulelwe kuleli zwe.</translation>
<translation id="4567424176335768812">Ungene ngemvume njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" />. Manje ungakwazi ukufinyelela amabhukhimakhi, umlando, nezinye izilungiselelo kuwo wonke amadivayisi wakho ongene kuwo ngemvume.</translation>
<translation id="4571503333518166079">Hamba kuzilungiselelo zesaziso se-tomi</translation>
<translation id="4575717501879784448">Itomi ingenza lawa mathebhu angasebenzi ukuthuthukisa okwenzekayo lapho ubhrawuza iphinde ikhulule izinsiza.</translation>
<translation id="459622048091363950">Uma i-tomi inokufinyelela, amawebhusayithi azokwazi ukukucela ukufinyelela.</translation>
<translation id="4600710005438004015">I-tomi ayikwazanga ukubuyekezela kwinguqulo yakamuva, ngakho-ke uyalahlekelwa kuzici ezintsha nokulungiswa kokuphepha.</translation>
<translation id="4624065194742029982">I-tomi Incognito</translation>
<translation id="4627412468266359539">Okokuzikhethela: Siza ukuthuthukisa izakhi nokusebenza kwe-tomiOS Flex ngokuthumela ngokuzenzekelayo idatha yokuxilongwa nokusetshenziswa ku-tomi.</translation>
<translation id="4633000520311261472">Ukwenza i-tomi ivikeleke, sikhubaze ezinye izandiso ezingafakwanga kuhlu lwe-<ph name="IDS_EXTENSION_WEB_STORE_TITLE" /> futhi okungenzeka zifakwe ngaphandle kolwazi lakho.</translation>
<translation id="4680828127924988555">Khansela Ukufaka</translation>
<translation id="469553575393225953">Izandiso, ama-app, namatimu asuka emithonjeni engaziwa angalimaza idivayisi yakho. I-tomi incoma ukuwafaka kuphela kusuka ku-tomi Web Store</translation>
