<translation id="479167709087336770">Lokhu kusebenzisa isihloli sokupeleta esifanayo naleso esisetshenziswe kusesho lwe-tomi. Umbhalo owuthayiphayo kusiphequluli uthunyelwa ku-tomi. Ungahlala ushintsha le mpatho kuzilungiselelo.</translation>
