<translation id="7785741298021097183">I-tomi idizayinelwe ukushesha futhi ivikeleke kuwo wonkana amadivayisi akho — kusukela efonini yakho ukuya ekhompyutheni yakho.</translation>
<translation id="7787950393032327779">Iphrofayela ibonakala isetshenziswa enye inqubo ye-tomi (<ph name="PROCESS_ID" />) kwenye ikhompyutha (<ph name="HOST_NAME" />).  I-tomi ikhiye iphrofayela ukuze ingamosheki. Uma uqinisekile ukuthi azikho ezinye izinqubo ezisebenzisa le phrofayela, ungavula iphrofayela uphinde uqalise kabusha i-tomi.</translation>
