<translation id="8013993649590906847">Uma isithombe singenayo incazelo ephelele, i-tomi izozama ukukunikezela eyodwa. Ukuze udale izincazelo, izithombe zithunyelwa ku-tomi.</translation>
<translation id="8019103195866286235">Lesi sandiso sisuswe ukushicilela ngunjiniyela waso, futhi kungenzeka sibe esingaphephile. Sisuse ku-tomi ukuze singasakwazi ukubona nokushintsha idatha yakho kumasayithi owavakashelayo, okufaka phakathi ulwazi lwakho lomuntu siqu.</translation>
