<translation id="8255190535488645436">I-tomi isebenzisa ikhamela yakho nemakrofoni.</translation>
<translation id="8257796129973882597">Ungavula amabhukhimakhi, imodi yokufunda, nokuningi kusukela kumenyu ye-tomi</translation>
<translation id="8267953129876836456">Uma ivuliwe, i-tomi ilayisha kuqala amakhasi okwenza ukuphequlula nokusesha kusheshe.</translation>
<translation id="8270775718612349140">Izitifiketi eziphethwe i-tomi</translation>
<translation id="8286862437124483331">I-tomi izama ukubonisa amaphasiwedi. Thayipha iphasiwedi yakho ye-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="8290100596633877290">Habe! I-tomi iphahlazekile. Qalisa kabusha manje?</translation>
