<translation id="8336463659890584292">Lapho isayithi icela ukulayisha kusengaphambili ngasese amalinki ekhasini layo, i-tomi isebenzisa amaseva e-tomi. Lokhu kusiza umazisi wakho kusayithi elayishwe ngaphambilini, kodwa i-tomi ifunda ukuthi yimaphi amasayithi alayishwa ngaphambilini.</translation>
<translation id="8342675569599923794">Leli fayela liyingozi, ngakho-ke i-tomi ilivimbile.</translation>
<translation id="8349795646647783032"><ph name="BEGIN_BOLD" />Indlela esisebenzisa ngayo le datha:<ph name="END_BOLD" /> Amasayithi angagcina ulwazi nge-tomi mayelana nezintshisekelo zakho. Ngokwesibonelo, uma uvakashela isayithi ukuze uthenge izicathulo zomjaho webanga elide, isayithi lingachaza intshisekelo yakho njengokugijima umjaho. Kamuva, uma uvakashela isayithi elihlukile ukuze ubhalisele umjaho, lelo sayithi lingakubonisa isikhangiso sezicathulo zokugijima ezisekelwe kuzintshisekelo zakho.</translation>
