<translation id="8383226135083126309"><ph name="BEGIN_BOLD" />Indlela esisebenzisa ngayo le datha:<ph name="END_BOLD" /> I-tomi ingalinganisela izintshisekelo zakho. Kamuva, isayithi olivakashelayo lingacela i-tomi ukuthi ibone izintshisekelo zakho ukuze yenze izikhangiso ozibonayo ngokwezifiso zakho.</translation>
